@startuml
!include puml-style.iuml
participant "Test client" as C
participant "Engine" as E
participant "Target\n(on the board)" as T
C -> E : launch
C -> E : enable trace
C -> E : set breakpoint (main.c:106)
C -> E : continue
E -> T : resume
T --> E : breakpoint halt
E -> T : drain the sink
E --> C : trace data\n(instructions, function blocks)
E --> C : stopped
note over C : assert: trace data arrives before the halt,\ninstructions resolve to source lines,\na function block is named "main"
C -> E : continue
E -> T : resume
T --> E : breakpoint halt
E --> C : trace data\n(continues from the previous index)
E --> C : stopped
note over C : assert: the record accumulates\nacross the two captures
@enduml
